id: pm-pfxi
title: "assertExtensionManifestMatchesBlueprint(manifest, blueprint): strict least-privilege CI guard against capability drift"
description: "Throwing testing helper in src/sdk/testing.ts. Reconciles manifest.capabilities against deriveExtensionCapabilities(blueprint) via lintExtensionBlueprint, then throws on ANY capability finding -> undeclared (would crash activation with extension_capability_missing) AND unused (least-privilege violation). The STRICT bookend to the lenient assertExtensionBlueprint (which only warns on unused). Returns {used, declared, missing, unused, findings} on an exact match."
